"""Hub pages built from what the site already publishes: glossary (/glossary/), best-of lists (/best/), FAQ hub (/faq/)
and "near" pages (/near/<town>/), in en/es/id. Wire-up: add pages_hubs to MODULES in build.py.
Helpers for build.py: pages_hubs.nearby_html(g, item, l) and pages_hubs.glossary_links(g, html, l).
Glossary texts draw only on our published guides plus the external pages listed in SRC (opened 14 Nov 2026)."""
import json, re, html, math

def esc(s): return html.escape(str(s), quote=True)
